### AI02 unconfirmed scenario
POST http://localhost:3000/planning/executions
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "forecastName": "Week-45",
  "scenarioName": "Unconfirmed-Scenario"
}

### Expected response (409)
{
  "error": {
    "message": "Scenario must be confirmed before execution"
  }
}
